Explanation of the change:

- We remove the overly broad test `(isExpanded(element) && !is(oldBusinessObject, 'bpmn:Task'))` (which applies when turning a call activity into a subprocess, since a call‐activity is always expanded), and instead guard the size copy with `isSubProcess(oldBusinessObject)`.  
- This ensures that only when you replace _one_ expanded SubProcess with _another_ expanded SubProcess will the old width/height be re-used. In all other cases (e.g. CallActivity → SubProcess) you fall back on the default subprocess size.
